00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:05.600
One of the reasons why it's so important

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:07.810
to wear a face covering

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:09.740
is that we know now that

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:14.740
about 40 to 45% of the
people who are infected,

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.020
don't have any symptoms,

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:21.190
and yet, they have virus
in their nasal pharynx.

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:22.850
And we know that

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:26.580
a substantial proportion of
infections are transmitted

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:28.960
from someone who doesn't
have any symptoms.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:31.530
So people have an understandable

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:34.290
but incorrect interpretation,

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.590
that the only time you transmit infection

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:40.180
is when you're coughing and
sneezing all over someone.

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:42.100
What they don't appreciate,

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:43.960
is that if you are speaking,

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:46.490
even if you don't speak loudly,

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:49.590
and if you are singing,
which is even worse,

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:51.180
than just speaking,

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:53.930
you have these particles that come out,

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:56.750
that can stay in the air
for a period of time,

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.530
some of them dropped to the ground,

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:00.230
which is the reason why we say

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.450
keep six feet of distance,

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:05.030
but some of them are aerosolized

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:08.130
and can hang around the
air for a period of time.

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:09.130
For that reason,

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:12.300
it's so important to wear face coverings,

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:15.900
