00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:44.430
Oh, absolutely.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.330
And that's the reason why

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:49.240
when we conduct these clinical trials,

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:52.740
you want to do it in
a scientifically sound

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:56.460
and ethically sound manner
where you absolutely prove

00:07:56.460 --> 00:08:00.140
definitively that a vaccine
is safe and effective,

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:02.750
which is really the case with so many

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.380
of the life saving vaccines that

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:08.430
we've done similar types of tests on

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:11.790
because if you get only a small proportion

00:08:13.215 --> 00:08:16.210
of the population vaccinated,

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:19.000
the vax the virus still has the capability

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.600
of spreading around

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.780
to those people who are not vaccinated.

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:25.390
No, you've heard about hard immunity,

00:08:25.390 --> 00:08:27.800
which means if you get enough people

00:08:28.844 --> 00:08:30.490
who are either infected and protected

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:33.090
or vaccinated and protected,

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:36.120
you have kind of a shield
over the community.

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:39.390
But that's got to be a
substantial proportion

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:41.810
of the of the population
that's vaccinated.

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:43.150
In addition,

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:47.130
it also depends on the
efficacy level of the vaccine.

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:49.100
Because if you have a vaccine,

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:51.760
that's only 70% effective,

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.420
you've got to have even more

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.430
of the population vaccinated.

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:58.630
So you need a highly effective vaccine.

00:08:58.630 --> 00:09:00.750
And the overwhelming majority

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:02.810
of the population being vaccinated.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.520
And is that percentage we can expect?

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:07.800
So 70 to 75% effectiveness?

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:09.870
You know, I hope so,

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:12.460
the trials are geared

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:17.040
two of them to detect a 60% efficacy

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:19.150
with a degree of certainty.

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:21.420
And one what I think is a 50%,

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.170
the ones that are out in front right now

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:25.380
are looking at it 60%.

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:27.000
I would hope

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:31.490
that we could get a 70 plus
percent effective vaccine

00:09:31.490 --> 00:09:35.440
because if we then vaccinate widely,

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:38.500
and combine that with continuation

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:40.610
of certain of the public health measures,

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:43.390
you don't necessarily
need to be as stringent

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.160
but some of them like mask wearing

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:48.670
and avoiding crowds without a mask,

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:52.440
which is a sure-fire
invitation to a problem.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:54.760
And what would you say is
the most important thing

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.150
that we know now

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.010
that we didn't necessarily know,

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:01.010
say in March or when, lockdown started.

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:03.040
You know, I think it's
exactly what you said,

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:05.950
and there were a few
things we didn't know,

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:09.640
we didn't know what percentage of people

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:13.230
were asymptomatic carriers of the virus.

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:16.370
We didn't know the extent
to which they could spread.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:20.540
And we didn't know the
full spectrum of disease,

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:21.450
it was either well,

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:23.040
either you go to the hospital and you die

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:25.200
or you get better and you're fine.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:27.860
We know now that there are some people,

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:30.810
maybe a significant number
of lingering symptoms

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:32.900
that go on for weeks, if not months,

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.370
and maybe longer.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:35.960
We know that children

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:40.900
can have a very unusual
hyper inflammatory syndrome,

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:42.580
which is very similar to

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.780
a strange disease called Kawasaki disease,

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:48.930
where they get skin
rashes and mucosal rashes.

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:51.340
They often go to an ICU,

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:53.830
they often have to be hospitalized.

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:56.590
That's something that we
need to take seriously.

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:58.810
And would you say this
quite a weird question,

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:01.000
