00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:07.060
Well, it's interesting and perplexing.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:09.570
You know, one of the things
that people have asked me

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:12.400
I've been involved in, as I say,

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:16.893
chasing pandemic outbreaks
for now over 36 years,

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:19.900
ever since the very early days

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:22.933
of the HIV AIDS pandemic.

00:11:24.349 --> 00:11:26.220
And when people asked me, what's your

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:28.650
worst case scenario,

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:30.530
what's your worst nightmare,

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:31.390
I would always say

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:33.710
it would be a new infection

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:36.740
that jumps species from
an animal reservoir,

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.640
and has two characteristics

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:42.600
one, that it spreads
very, very efficiently

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:44.110
from human to human.

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:47.550
And two, it has a substantial
degree of morbidity

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:48.960
and mortality,

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:50.930
either for the general population

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:54.800
or for a certain subgroup of individuals.

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:57.890
And we've had examples of outbreaks

00:11:57.890 --> 00:12:00.810
that have had one or the other
of those characteristics,

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:03.030
but not both of them together.

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:04.053
Right,

00:12:04.053 --> 00:12:04.886
You know,

00:12:04.886 --> 00:12:06.100
and when you have both of them together,

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:10.110
then you have a historic outbreak,

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:14.080
the likes of which we have
not seen in 102 years,

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.650
since the 1918, famous

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:19.560
or infamous Spanish flu.

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:22.220
So this is something that as you know,

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:25.800
involves over 215 countries,

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.200
we now have,

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:30.870
you know, a considerable 10s
of millions of infections

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:33.840
worldwide with close to a million deaths

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:35.690
in this our own country,

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:38.110
we have more than 6 million infections.

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:39.690
And now very close,

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.900
if not already at 200,000 deaths.

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:44.570
This is quite serious.

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.240
I actually watched the
documentary about the 80s,

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:48.130
