00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:58.170
Okay, I do have one final question.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:12:59.240
What has been

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:03.000
personally for you the
most frustrating thing

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:03.930
about this pandemic?

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:06.670
You know, what the most
frustrating thing for me is,

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:10.210
is the lack of a of a uniform response.

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:11.150
among the states.

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:13.300
You know, one of the great
things about our country

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:15.960
is we have federalism and
the states have the power

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:17.620
to do what they want to do.

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:19.790
The only difficulty with that

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:23.710
is that often you have
different viewpoints

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:25.840
and different issues that come up,

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:28.330
and states may do something different.

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:30.560
The other frustrating issue

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:34.623
is the lack of appreciation
on the part of young people,

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:36.960
who for the most part,

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.630
do very well with this
with some exceptions.

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.600
I mean, compared to the elderly,

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:43.700
and those with chronic conditions,

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:46.310
is their lack of appreciation,

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:48.280
that by getting infected

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:50.100
and not caring if they get infected,

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.760
like people you see at bars,

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.133
crowded no masks,

00:13:53.133 --> 00:13:56.430
that they are actually
propagating the outbreak.

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:58.030
So they are part

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:00.570
of the continuation of something

00:14:00.570 --> 00:14:02.520
that we're trying to stop.

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:04.060
And although they innocently

00:14:04.060 --> 00:14:06.470
and inadvertently get infected

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:07.890
and think they're in a vacuum,

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:10.850
that they're not gonna
be harming anyone else.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:12.590
What happens is that

00:14:12.590 --> 00:14:14.240
they may be without symptoms,

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:17.670
but they'll transmit the
infection to someone else

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:21.030
who might transmit it to
someone who is vulnerable.

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:22.530
That could be someone's

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:24.380
father or grandfather,

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:28.040
or wife who's on chemotherapy
for breast cancer

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:30.410
or a child is immunodeficient.

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:33.530
So I'm frustrated by
the lack of appreciation

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:35.560
that we are all in this together

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:38.720
and we're gonna end it
by ending it together

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:41.100
not having some people pay attention

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:43.500
to what they should be
doing and other people not.

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:44.333
Yeah, absolutely.

00:14:44.333 --> 00:14:45.750
It makes it extra frustrating

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:47.390
for those of us who have

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:49.240
hardly been out and you know,

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:50.390
wear masks all the time

00:14:50.390 --> 00:14:51.470
when we do go out when you just

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:55.440
see people in the media doing
absolutely nothing at all.

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:56.860
It makes it makes everything

00:14:56.860 --> 00:14:58.690
that we've been doing
seem a bit pointless.

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:00.550
Well, not pointless for yourself

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:02.180
but pointless for the outbreak

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:03.380
in other words pointless

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:04.968
to get control of the outbreak easily.

00:15:04.968 --> 00:15:07.030
You make a very good point.

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:08.640
Well Dr. Fauci thank you very much

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:11.640
