00:15:14.804 --> 00:15:16.430
for humans on this planet.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:17.710
Well, thank you, I appreciate

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:19.070
you having me on your programme.

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:19.910
Thank you.

